     "p": {
      "ar": "**take on board** (خد الملاحظة في الاعتبار) واكتب خطوة: «I’ll start each update with the status in one line.» وبعد أسبوعين ارجع: «I’ve been trying the one-line status. Is it better?». ده بيبني ثقة كبيرة.",
      "en": "**Take it on board** and write a step: «I’ll start each update with the status in one line.» Two weeks later go back: «I’ve been trying the one-line status. Is it better?». This builds a lot of trust."
     },
     "ex": "\"I’ve taken that on board. Starting today, each update begins with the status. Can I check with you in two weeks?\""
